        "original_id": "95dda4ed-1db3-5eeb-b9ce-4af7e3b964bb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Series: V (2009 TV series)\n- TV Miniseries: V (1983 miniseries)\n- People: Kenneth Johnson, Elizabeth Mitchell, Morena Baccarin, Scott Rosenbaum, Yves Simoneau, Scott Peters, Steve Pearlman, Jace Hall\n- Concepts: alien invasion, remake, executive production\n\nFacts:\n- Kenneth Johnson created the 1983 miniseries V.\n- V (2009 TV series) is a remake of the 1983 miniseries V.\n- V (2009 TV series) chronicles the arrival on Earth of a technologically advanced alien species that appears peaceful but actually has sinister motives.\n- V (2009 TV series) stars Elizabeth Mitchell and Morena Baccarin.\n- V (2009 TV series) was executive produced by Scott Rosenbaum, Yves Simoneau, Scott Peters, Steve Pearlman, and Jace Hall.\n- Morena Silva de Vaz Setta Baccarin was born on June 2, 1979.\n- Morena Baccarin is a Brazilian American actress.",
